==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3~14 seconds<sup>90f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 3~14 seconds<sup>90f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
There are lots of [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] peons in this stage, so you will likely have a battle on two fronts, one being against the Teacher Bear and one against the Zombies that burrowed/block your new units from reaching the fight.

The addition of two Zir Zeals to this stage shouldn't pose too much of a problem, but beware of their rapid Area Attacks and long burrow range. This makes them a real hazard if the player is not prepared. However, by rushing the stage with Giraffe Cat you can most likely beat this stage before the Zir Zeals become a problem.

